gshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004","text":"累遷太子洗馬，中舍人，並掌東宮管記。昭明太子愛文學士，常與筠及劉孝綽、陸倕、到洽、殷芸等游宴玄圃，太子獨執筠袖撫孝綽肩而言曰：「所謂左把浮丘袖，右拍洪崖肩。」其見重如此。筠又與殷芸以方雅見禮焉。出爲丹陽尹丞、北中郎諮議參軍，遷中書郎。奉敕制《開善寺寶誌大師碑文》，詞甚麗逸。又敕撰《中書表奏》三十卷，及所上賦頌，都爲一集。俄兼寧遠湘東王長史，行府、國、郡事。除太子家令，復掌管記。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:u0023","person_id":null,"surface":"文學士","start":23,"end":26,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"太子文學士合稱。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0029","person_id":"mxz_qw8_acd_A","surface":"筠","start":29,"end":30,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0031","person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","surface":"劉孝綽","start":31,"end":34,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0035","person_id":"war_qdw_fs5","surface":"陸倕","start":35,"end":37,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0038","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","surface":"到洽","start":38,"end":40,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0041","person_id":"8d4_fth_d4l","surface":"殷芸","start":41,"end":43,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0053","person_id":"mxz_qw8_acd_A","surface":"筠","start":53,"end":54,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0056","person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","surface":"孝綽","start":56,"end":58,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun:p004:m0068","person_id":"5fx_jxq_ms6","surface":"浮丘","start":68,"end":70,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同一見證的原字和敘事。"